{"3554220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Funorbit", "steam_appid": 3554220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funorbit</strong> is a physics-based pixel art space survival simulation where you navigate a vast, procedurally generated universe using realistic orbital mechanics. Master acceleration, deceleration, and gravitational forces to explore planets, moons, and drifting meteoroids, each with unique motion and spin. Collide with meteoroids to break them into pieces, evade cosmic dangers, and use your HUD to track real-time speed, distances, and directions as you travel through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from asteroids, moons, and wreckage to <strong>craft essential equipment, repair your ship, and build structures</strong> that aid in survival. Construct space stations, upgrade your shuttle, and manage your supplies as you adapt to the ever changing challenges of space. With <strong>immersive physics, dynamic encounters, and a deep crafting system</strong>, <strong>Funorbit </strong>is a test of skill, strategy, and survival in the infinite cosmos.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funorbit</strong> is a physics-based pixel art space survival simulation where you navigate a vast, procedurally generated universe using realistic orbital mechanics. Master acceleration, deceleration, and gravitational forces to explore planets, moons, and drifting meteoroids, each with unique motion and spin. Collide with meteoroids to break them into pieces, evade cosmic dangers, and use your HUD to track real-time speed, distances, and directions as you travel through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from asteroids, moons, and wreckage to <strong>craft essential equipment, repair your ship, and build structures</strong> that aid in survival. Construct space stations, upgrade your shuttle, and manage your supplies a